)}\n2438:7. **Every returned boundary, slow tier.** Run the existing corpus through `run-fuel 1`; lift, lower into isolated worlds, immediately relift, validate frames and continue to the reference outcome. Pin measured counts and the driver coverage classes of §3.6. Constructed post-sweep cases are reported separately.\n2442:9. **Layout gates.** At every reachable corpus PC, check register injectivity, jump/terminator layout availability and separate non-tail/tail set equations. On executed paths compare ordered region length and values to the ordered register sequence, including repeated-register agreement. Do not compare that sequence length to `|L(pc)|`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\np='test/yin/vm/semantic/layout_test.cljc'\ns=open(p).read().replace('[clojure.walk :as walk]','[clojure.walk :as walk]\\\\n            [clojure.set :as set]')\na=s.index('(deftest static-layouts-at-every-pc')\ns=s[:a]+'''(def dead-ambient-pcs\n  #{[:resume-operand 1] [:resume-operand 2]\n    [:tail-operand 1] [:tail-operand 2]})\n\n\n(deftest static-layouts-at-every-pc\n  (let [excluded (atom #{})]\n    (doseq [[label ast] C]\n      (let [v (projected ast) sg (layout/segment v) a (:analysis sg)]\n        (doseq [p (sort (reachable-pcs v))]\n          (testing (str label \\\" pc \\\" p)\n            (let [t (nth v p)\n                  ordered (layout/stack-layout sg p)\n                  live (analysis/live a p)\n                  uses (set (code/uses t))\n                  region (into (set ordered) uses)]\n              (is (vector? ordered))\n              (is (= (count live) (count (set (map #(layout/phys sg p %) live))))\n                  \\\"physical registers are injective on the live set\\\")\n              (if (code/tail-call? t)\n                (is (= uses live))\n                (do\n                  (is (set/subset? uses live))\n                  (is (set/subset? live region))\n                  (if (contains? dead-ambient-pcs [label p])\n                    (do\n                      (swap\"'! excluded conj [label p])\n                      (is (= #{1} (set/difference (set ordered) live))\n                          \"exactly the enclosing application'\"'s abandoned operator\\\")\n                      (is (= :var (first (nth v 0))))\n                      (is (contains? #{:resume :call} (first (nth v 2))))\n                      (is (or (= :resume (first (nth v 2)))\n                              (code/tail-call? (nth v 2)))))\n                    (is (= live region))))))))))\n    (is (= dead-ambient-pcs @excluded))))\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
