{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_66","type":"agent_message","text":"The new checks now cover running-plus-ready fenced recovery, illegal task products, all seven completion tags’ outcome slots, and independent shared-cursor continuation. The boundary tests have also exposed two driver assumptions I’m correcting: initialization can require several fuelled child rounds, and child frames must be validated against the child’s carried code.\n"}}
